\item OpenAI, \emph{Bounded-Step Walks on Gaussian Primes}, 2026-09-26; citation key \texttt{OAI:Bounded-Step-Walks-on-Gaussian-Primes-September-26-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Bounded-Step-Walks-on-Gaussian-Primes-September-26-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Bounded-Step-Walks-on-Gaussian-Primes-September-26-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Bounded-Step-Walks-on-Gaussian-Primes-September-26-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Bounded-Step-Walks-on-Gaussian-Primes-September-26-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Bounded-Step-Walks-on-Gaussian-Primes-September-26-2026/build/main.tex\#L63}{thm:main, cor:uniform}.
\item Family 028: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/028.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/ComparatorChallenges/GaussianMoat.json}{Comparator GaussianMoat.json}.
